settings-css-nested-at = @media 里不能再写 @ 规则
settings-css-at-rule = 不允许 @{ $name }，只允许 @media
settings-css-rules = 规则最多 { $max } 条
settings-css-nesting = 括号和函数最多嵌套 { $max } 层
settings-css-media-condition = @media 条件里只能写媒体特性
settings-css-attribute-selector = 属性选择器写法不正确
settings-css-selector-function = 选择器里不允许 { $name }()
settings-css-no-selector = 缺少选择器
settings-css-selector = 选择器写法不正确
settings-css-expected-property = 这里应当是属性名；不支持嵌套规则
settings-css-property = 不允许 { $property } 属性
settings-css-important-last = !important 只能写在值的最后
settings-css-bang = ! 后面只能是 important
settings-css-no-value = { $property } 缺少取值
settings-css-position = 不允许 position: fixed，position 只能写固定关键字
settings-css-content = content 只能是 none、normal 或空字符串
settings-css-z-index = z-index 只能是 auto 或 -1 到 20 的整数
settings-css-url = 不允许 url()
settings-css-function = 不允许 { $name }()
settings-css-value-at = 值里不允许 @
settings-css-value = 取值写法不正确
settings-error-style-invalid = 个人样式不符合规则
settings-error-style-conflict = 个人样式已被更新，请刷新后重试
settings-error-style-version-range = 个人样式版本超出范围
settings-error-reading-conflict = 阅读偏好已被更新，请刷新后重试
settings-error-reading-version-range = 阅读偏好版本超出范围
settings-error-duplicate-uids = uid 名单里有重复项
